{"id":"u-9fa163ea-7edb-4370-9eb9-57dcdfd595ec","src":"community","title":"[ 60 MINUTES ]  4 Day Powerbuilding Program","author":"J B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/nOlqns-absolute-tank-plus","desc":"Efficient Hypertrophy & Strength Program\n\nA time-smart workout plan for muscle growth and strength gains, cutting out fluff while maximizing progress.\n\nThese workouts are designed to be completed within 60-70 min, depending on resting periods and RPE targets.\n\nSuggested Workout Week:\n\nMonday: Day 1 - UPPER A\nTuesday: Day 2 - LOWER A\nWednesday: Rest\nThursday: Day 3 - UPPER B\nFriday: Day 4 - LOWER B\nSaturday: Rest\nSunday: Rest\n\nProgression Methods:\n\n1. Ethan Maclean’s Linear Approach\n\nStart at the lower rep range, then add reps weekly before increasing weight.\n*Example (3x4-8 Bench Press):*\nWeek 1: 3x4 @ 200lb\nWeek 2: 3x6 @ 200lb\nWeek 3: 3x7 @ 200lb\nWeek 4: 3x8 @ 200lb\nWeek 5: 3x4 @ 210lb (reset & repeat)\n\n2. Alexander Bromley’s Autoregulation (AMRAP-Based)\n\nPerform the last set as AMRAP—each extra rep = +1% of your 1RM next week.\n*Example (1RM = 400lb, hit 10 reps on a 6-rep target):*\n4 extra reps → +4% (15lb) to next week’s weight.\n\nDELOAD Every 4-5 Weeks.\n\nDrop compound lifts to 60% of your previous high; reduce accessory volume/sets.\n\nFlexible & Adaptable.\n\nSwap accessories as needed—tailor it to your goals.\nGet strong. Grow muscle. No wasted time.\n\nHope it helps. \n\n:)","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":18,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-27T00:08:21.108Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["UPPER A","LOWER A","UPPER B","LOWER B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":4}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Dip (Assisted)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bayesian